hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1397","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo shakhs mujh par aik martaba durood bhejta hai, Allah us par uske badley das martaba rehmat bhejta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1398","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din mujh se sab se zyada qareeb wo hoga jo mujh par sab se zyada durood bhejta hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1399","Aus bin Aus (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tumharey behtreen dinon mein se Juma ka din hai, isliye is din mujh par kasrat se durood bhejo, kyonke tumhara durood mujh par pesh kya jata hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Hamara durood Aap par kaisey pesh kya jaeyga jabke Aap (matti mein) bosida ho chukey hongey? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Azza wa Jall ne zameen par ambiya ke jismon ko haraam kar diya hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1400","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us aadmi ki naak khaak aalood ho jis ke saamney mera zikr kya jaey phir wo mujh par durood na bhejey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1401","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri qabr ko eidgaah na banao aur mujh par durood bhejo, kyonke tumhara durood mujh tak pahunchta hai tum jahan bhi ho. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1402","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi mujh par salaam bhejta hai to Allah meri rooh mujhey lauta deta hai yahan tak ke main uskey salaam ka jawab deta hun. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1403","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kanjoos wo hai jis ke saamney mera zikr kya jaey phir wo mujh par durood na bhejey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1404","Fazala bin Ubaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aadmi ko apni namaz mein dua kartey huey suna jis ne Allah Taala ki buzrugi bayan nahi ki thi aur na Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par durood bheja tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Is ne jaldi ki. Phir usey bulaya aur us se farmaya, ya kisi aur se farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz padhey to usey chahiye ke apne Rab Subhanahu ki hamd aur sana se shuru karey, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par durood bhejey phir uske baad jo chahey dua maangey. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Sahih hadis hai."
"1405","Abu Muhammad Kaab bin Ujra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas tashreef laey to ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham ne jaan liya ke ham Aap par salaam kaisey bhejein, to ham Aap par durood kaisey bhejein? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Muhammad par aur Aale Muhammad par rehmat bhej jaisa Tune Aale Ibrahim par rehmat bheji, beshak Tu hamd wala buzrugi wala hai. Ae Allah! Muhammad par aur Aale Muhammad par barkat bhej jaisa Tune Aale Ibrahim par barkat bheji, beshak Tu hamd wala buzrugi wala hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1406","Abu Masood bin Ubada Badri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas aey jabke ham Saad bin Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ki majlis mein they, to Basheer bin Saad ne un se kaha: Allah Taala ne hamein hukm diya hai ke ham Aap par durood bhejein ya Rasulullah, to ham Aap par durood kaisey bhejein? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh rahey yahan tak ke ham ne tamanna ki ke kaash us ne Aap se sawal na kya hota, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Muhammad par aur Aale Muhammad par rehmat bhej jaisa Tune Aale Ibrahim par rehmat bheji aur Muhammad par aur Aale Muhammad par barkat bhej jaisa Tune Aale Ibrahim par barkat bheji, beshak Tu hamd wala buzrugi wala hai, aur salaam waisa hi hai jaisa tum jaan chukey ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1407","Abu Humaid Saedi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham Aap par durood kaisey bhejein? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Muhammad par aur unki azwaaj aur unki aulaad par rehmat bhej jaisa Tune Aale Ibrahim par rehmat bheji, aur Muhammad par aur unki azwaaj aur unki aulaad par barkat bhej jaisa Tune Ibrahim par barkat bheji, beshak Tu hamd wala buzrugi wala hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
